dow), validation_failed (parked). pr_approved is deliberately NOT excluded: the sticky approval is exactly why REWORK is the right leg — after the rework push, validate-armed re-validates the new head and merge proceeds without a re-review (rework re-validates, never re-reviews); review-threads-resolved keeps excluding pr_approved so no review stacks on top. prMachineAuthor fails closed (owner rule: auto-rework is machine-only, same as fail_validation/conflict-rework). localAction arm_rework labels the PR agent:rework + explains in a comment; rework-on-label dispatches the leg (issue-anchored, PR-anchored fallback #544) and consumes the label.",
