 *     <branchPrefix><n> or a "#n" reference in the PR body) ENRICHES the
 *     observation (guards on prChecks / prMergeState apply only when a PR
 *     is linked — the Jira-era shape).
 *
 *   query: { type: 'pr', labels, notLabels, checks, mergeState, … }
